    "title": "Idlewild's HallowBOO Marks 22nd Year With Mazes, Mystic Train Ride - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Benjamin Clark ,\n21 hours ago Idlewild park is marking the 22nd season of HallowBOO, its family-oriented Halloween event tucked into the Laurel Highlands, with a trick-or-treat trail through Story Book Forest, a re-themed train ride and a lineup of mazes built for kids rather than scares. Children 12 and under can collect treats at stops along the trail, while the park promises shows, sing-alongs and seasonal food to round out the visit. Read full article",
